  "description": "Dalsu, the son of God, has been kicked out of the afterworld and sent to Earth on a mission: find out what makes humans truly happy. Teamed up with his friend Lisa, who happens to be an angel and talented chef, the two start a food delivery service. Because what could make humans happier than delivery food? Only when the happiness meter on his motorcycle hits 100% will he be allowed to return. Will Dalsu be able to make it back to the heavens? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
